Description: Include Messenger.h for BMessenger
 process_refs constructs a BMessenger to hand the resulting refs to
 Tracker. The upstream file relies on the legacy headers pulling
 Messenger.h in transitively; the packaged headers do not, so BMessenger
 is an incomplete type and the build stops. Include it explicitly; the
 application signature the messenger targets matches what V\OS Tracker
 ships.
Author: VitruvianOS Packagers <packages@vitruvianos.org>
Forwarded: not-needed
Origin: upstream
--- a/sources/opentargetfolder.cpp
+++ b/sources/opentargetfolder.cpp
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include <Path.h>
 #include <Entry.h>
 #include <Alert.h>
+#include <Messenger.h>
 
 #include <stdio.h>
 #include <string.h>
